  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatchling 263, or 'Glitch' as he's become known, was found abandoned near the mainframe ruins. Rumor has it he was an experimental project that escaped the clutches of the toxic waste barons, with strange side effects from Chrono-Hide infusion.",
